{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 'Wonderia', a unique open-world game set on an alien planet. Your journey combines survival, creativity, and exploration in a dynamic, procedurally generated environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/3ed49ef8cd042a9df780ce9c91976aba.poster.avif?t=1763008287\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/3ed49ef8cd042a9df780ce9c91976aba.webm?t=1763008287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/3ed49ef8cd042a9df780ce9c91976aba.mp4?t=1763008287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/b815f6515d2ad3387c06d47847f9aaba.avif?t=1763008287\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize homes for space travelers, influencing them to make this world their new home. Your constructions directly affect the planet's landscape and ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast, ever-changing sandbox world. Uncover resources and secrets hidden across diverse landscapes, each offering unique challenges and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/83d0c1f03f953f5ec23ce8d3b3da9f9a.poster.avif?t=1763008287\" width=610 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/83d0c1f03f953f5ec23ce8d3b3da9f9a.webm?t=1763008287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/83d0c1f03f953f5ec23ce8d3b3da9f9a.mp4?t=1763008287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into mysterious dungeons scattered across the planet. Navigate through complex labyrinths and uncover hidden treasures in these subterranean realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/97fc65ac60c416b2261bf698a1170202.poster.avif?t=1763008287\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/97fc65ac60c416b2261bf698a1170202.webm?t=1763008287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/97fc65ac60c416b2261bf698a1170202.mp4?t=1763008287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate an alien garden, planting seeds collected on your travels. Delve into the art of fishing, capturing exotic aquatic species in hidden nooks of the planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with your harvests and catches in the kitchen, concocting culinary creations that offer surprising benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 'Wonderia' solo or with up to 7 others in multiplayer mode. Work together or compete in constructing, exploring, and surviving on this alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/b81acfdca7a8f96dd2f906bd0bbba5ee.poster.avif?t=1763008287\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/b81acfdca7a8f96dd2f906bd0bbba5ee.webm?t=1763008287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/b81acfdca7a8f96dd2f906bd0bbba5ee.mp4?t=1763008287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Wonderia' offers a blend of adventure and creativity, where your decisions shape the world and your experience in this alien landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/80c4d196626670c1f8663a878cb55e70.poster.avif?t=1763008287\" width=908 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/80c4d196626670c1f8663a878cb55e70.webm?t=1763008287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/extras/80c4d196626670c1f8663a878cb55e70.mp4?t=1763008287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801710?t=1763008287","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801710?t=1763008287","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/7f775ecdf31ade2a2b503c0c088e913eb3a7715c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763008287","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801710/7f775ecdf31ade2a2b503c0c088e913eb3a7715c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763008287","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"